@startuml
title Evidence Anchoring Flow — Sequence Diagram

actor Developer
participant "Web Application UI"
participant "Backend API"
participant "Hashing and Commitment Service"
participant "Cardano Network"

Developer -> "Web Application UI" : upload evidence
"Web Application UI" -> "Backend API" : submit evidence
"Backend API" -> "Hashing and Commitment Service" : compute SHA-256
"Hashing and Commitment Service" -> "Cardano Network" : anchor hash
"Cardano Network" --> "Hashing and Commitment Service" : TXID
"Hashing and Commitment Service" --> "Backend API" : hash + TXID
"Backend API" -> "Web Application UI" : record reference

@enduml